{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方高亮白色的大号正文段落，第一眼落在开头几行；右上角目录和下方音符动画明显是次要视觉信息。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人正在犹豫自己为什么想回去，但具体是怀念曾经被接纳的日子，还是害怕孤单，第一眼不一定能判断清楚。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"迷茫、心慌、不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"舍不得被当作自己人的日子与害怕孤单这两种动机之间的具体区别；过去的自己经历过什么，以及为什么如今仍然没有简单答案。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思。\",\n    \"核心处境和感受需要读完开头较长的句子才能建立完整关系。\",\n    \"后半段音乐意象与人物心理交织，第一眼不容易判断哪些是叙事信息、哪些是音乐描写。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0032e437-5457-4e39-92af-279ac4d1302d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T015541992158Z", "elapsed_seconds": 28.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:56:10.335227+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1f1050a5aa4355d9f35fe2cf2114154783e73664cbccadf92292f5515589969a", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3